<title>CANADA: Groupe Videtron unit acquires five stores.</title>
<headline>Groupe Videtron unit acquires five stores.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Groupe Videotron Ltee said on Monday that its unit, Le SuperClub Videotron Ltee, has acquired five stores from the Place Video chain.</p>
<p>The acquisition boosts SuperClub's network to 90 retail outlets throughout Quebec, Groupe Videotron said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
